[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5284135184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122381#issuecomment-5284135184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122381","id":5284135184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOvWBEA","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T17:28:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T17:28:22Z","body":"Why did the warning go missing in the first place? \r\n\r\nI'm not sure about being more permissive, since we should be using ETC/ASTC on all platforms that support it. But it seems like this doesn't address the cause of the regression in the first place. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5284135184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5284580043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122381#issuecomment-5284580043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122381","id":5284580043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOvxKyw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T18:09:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T18:09:00Z","body":"> Why did the warning go missing in the first place?\r\n\r\nThere are two checks for some reason, one in dialog UI and one in each of export plugins (message from latter was suppressed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119806 and only shows in CLI exports), to avoid duplicate warnings in UI.\r\n\r\nBut these two check had different conditions, this PR changes it to be the same.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eb491cb578623d8388a0cfaf1b44e52a482e518e/editor/export/project_export.cpp#L416-L422\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eb491cb578623d8388a0cfaf1b44e52a482e518e/platform/macos/export/export_plugin.cpp#L2488-L2503\r\n\r\nx86_64 macOS doesn't support ASTC (and support of ETC varies), and ARM64 supports both ASTC/ETC2 and S3TC/BPTC.\r\n\r\nSo for universal export (default and the way official templates are built), S3TC/BPTC is the only required format. And for ARM64 only expert it's reasonable to enforce ASTC/ETC2.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5284580043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361779352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122381#issuecomment-5361779352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122381","id":5361779352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP5ZCmA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T21:18:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T21:18:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361779352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}